  skos:definition "Whether the respondent currently has paid work, including partial sick leave and job loss due to long-term complaints."@en ;
  skos:scopeNote "Theme: demographics / work. Instrument: none. Datatype: coded. Value set: vs:paidjob-4. Employment-related concept only; response options are PCNN-specific."@en ;
  skos:relatedMatch <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C95551> .

